**`src/inventory.py`** (4 bugs)
- `__init__`: mutable default `{}` shared state across instances → `None` default with `dict(initial)`
- `add`: overwrote stock instead of accumulating → `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`
- `reserve`: used `>=` for available check, blocking exact-quantity reserves → changed to `>`
- `release`: allowed reserved count to go negative → added guard that raises `ValueError`

**`src/text_utils.py`** (3 bugs)
- `slugify`: didn't lowercase → now lowercases each alphanumeric char
- `slugify`: `replace("--", "-")` only collapsed one pair → switched to `re.sub(r"-+", "-", …)`
- `truncate`: didn't account for suffix length in max length → `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`
